Sign with the algorithms of the SSL_CTX or the SSL, whichever credential signs.

SSL_CTX_set1_sigalgs_list and SSL_set1_sigalgs_list store the signing
preferences on the legacy credential, so one that SSL_CTX_add1_credential added
(an RSA and an ECDSA certificate side by side) signs with the defaults.
OpenSSL's list covers every certificate.

